Package: alder
Title: Reactive Notebook Helpers for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Carl", "Stone", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "carl@alder.dev")
Description: R helpers for reactive notebooks and ordinary Rscript programs.
    Alder provides validated user-interface values, rich output records,
    and dependency-aware computation caches. The public R surface remains usable without an
    application process; interactive execution, persistence, and rendering are
    owned by the application host.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/carl-stone/alder
BugReports: https://github.com/carl-stone/alder/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.6.0)
Imports:
    codetools,
    mime,
    rlang
Suggests:
    microbenchmark,
    processx,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
